    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ecd899188dcdca124b7d5324",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我与这样的东瀛佐敦\n一起挑战闪耀系列赛的日常，\n就此展开！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bf168464bde00e7daf467bed27ee763508b6d95bdb43a6d9c48b3d7c279ebf5c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
