    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa6e463a86924acde275c850",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这个活动培养了她的观察力。\n而在成长的同时，她注意到了。\n……自己并没有像四周的人那样受到瞩目。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7759807a7650ecb8517e0e3f76b2549cab0924a82615f25b7f163b197fccbc25",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
