    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5c8c7ba7b30090450dd19539",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她像是要挥去那郁闷的心情般，\n全心全意地跑着。这时有位在“希望S”时\n对她产生兴趣的记者前来采访。",
      "source_fingerprint": "325909d2a4323c57c2e8c3eeaa471fb921e3806fbf1349c4aa1eb6826827afd3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
