    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc069c7322de3ebb81f6517a",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "但在这一瞬间，东瀛佐敦感受到剧烈疼痛──\n她的脚趾甲……裂开了。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7533ce5183e814fe0e74554d5d02b21db7ef288c0d1061ef4aee80402eb84c96",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
