    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d63ec1de4ab8f9507992a22e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "辞退“皋月赏”……甚至浮现出这个念头时，\n东瀛佐敦含泪乞求训练员，\n说她绝对要参加比赛。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cd29c2e8a6bc2e765a3fde654334bb681b2f902187c80aeef969dd4f26c32882",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
