    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c0cd2d02a5442791224f0e3b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "训练员理解东瀛佐敦的决心后，\n决定选择在治疗脚趾甲的同时，\n也不放弃“皋月赏”的道路。",
      "source_fingerprint": "c9de1a5c01fd48d9bf79ec0bec02bdc9ec2c43841b9245e1ebdd6318f6a61cb6",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
