      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "东瀛佐敦与新交到的辣妹朋友们，\n每天都过得很开心。",
      "source_fingerprint": "87f5362bbc6907ba3bf7287e57aa0af671752a9f4647284d66946960aeaf4cc6",
