      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "为自己加油的声音\n令她非常难为情……却又很愉悦。\n神色也自然地开朗了起来。",
      "source_fingerprint": "68bf741aab55370dcb9e5dfd42f5d4e650726da66c9e7fbf34190ae91ed495f9",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
